          "value": "<svg><polygon points=\"799.2,668.6 2241.1,625 2281.1,1554.2 1847.4,1716.8 1269.1,1762 1720.9,1978.9 2100.4,1933.7 1937.8,5900.6 1124.5,5412.6 934.7,5728.9 681.7,5647.6\"></polygon></svg>"
